WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.147
Watch and read: Ama asks: Which word contains the digraph “sh”?

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:09.558
The answer is: ship. A digraph uses two letters to represent one sound.

00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:13.844
Watch and read: Which is the correctly written familiar word?

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:18.412
The answer is: the. Look carefully at the letters from left to right.
